Package: ZarrArray
Title: Zarr datasets as array-like objects in R
Description: The ZarrArray package is a Zarr backend for DelayedArray objects.
	It leverages the Rarr and DelayedArray packages to implement the
	ZarrArray class, a DelayedArray extension for representing and
	manipulating a Zarr dataset in R. ZarrArray objects support all
	operations (delayed or block-processed) supported by DelayedArray
	objects.
biocViews: Infrastructure, DataRepresentation, DataImport
